{{Short description|US Research Organization}}
The '''Microsystems Technology Office''' ('''MTO''') is one of seven current organizational divisions of [[DARPA]], an [[government agency|agency]] responsible for the development of new technology for the [[United States Armed Forces]]. It is sometimes referred to as the '''Microelectronics Technology Office'''.

The office focuses on the development of [[microelectromechanical systems]] (MEMS),<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Microelectromechanical_Systems.aspx|title=MEMS|publisher=[[DARPA]] MTO|accessdate=2012-08-26|url-status=dead|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20110305081012/http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Microelectromechanical_Systems.aspx|archivedate=2011-03-05}}</ref> electronics,<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Electronics.aspx|title=Electronics|publisher=[[DARPA]] MTO|accessdate=2012-08-26|url-status=dead|archiveurl=https://archive.today/20121212041759/http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Electronics.aspx|archivedate=2012-12-12}}</ref> [[algorithm]]s,<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Algorithms.aspx|title=Algorithms|publisher=[[DARPA]] MTO|accessdate=2012-08-26|url-status=dead|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20120603222511/http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Algorithms.aspx|archivedate=2012-06-03}}</ref> [[systems architecture]],<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Architectures.aspx|title=Architectures|publisher=[[DARPA]] MTO|accessdate=2012-08-26|url-status=dead|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20120603215033/http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Architectures.aspx|archivedate=2012-06-03}}</ref> and [[photonics]].<ref>{{cite web|url=http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Photonics.aspx|title=Photonics|publisher=[[DARPA]] MTO|accessdate=2012-08-26|url-status=dead|archiveurl=https://web.archive.org/web/20120915112039/http://www.darpa.mil/Our_Work/MTO/Focus_Areas/Photonics.aspx|archivedate=2012-09-15}}</ref>

